# MacCog-internal subagent ops board — not for public dlcOS distribution.
# Anchored with a leading slash so it ONLY ignores the repo-root ops-board dir,
# NOT plugins/dlcOS/agents/ (the shipped, distributed agents — a bare `agents/`
# pattern matches a dir of that name at ANY depth and would hide shipped agents).
/agents/
